It covers sections 18.12 to 18.15.

17
00:01:15,891 --> 00:01:21,820
A ruleset, as a reminder, is a named list
of rules with a target, an enforcement

18
00:01:21,860 --> 00:01:23,686
status and a bypass list.

19
00:01:24,026 --> 00:01:29,271
Tag rulesets: rules for refs under refs/tags/,
