rules do not appear there.

201
00:15:08,384 --> 00:15:14,432
Then create the tag ruleset as section 18.12
describes: kind tag, target v[0-9]* or

202
00:15:14,472 --> 00:15:20,520
v* after you have tested the pattern, with
restrict updates, restrict deletions and

203
00:15:20,560 --> 00:15:24,775
block force pushes, enforcement
Active, bypass list empty.

204
00:15:24,815 --> 00:15:30,716
Test it as the replay did, with a throwaway
